          "source": {
            "book": "textbook",
            "page": 149
          },
          "pronunciation": "Keoseo mwoga doego sipeunyae?"
        },
        {
          "id": "cold-question",
          "term": "유나가 밖이 추우냬요.",
          "gloss": "Yuna asks whether it is cold outside.",
          "source": {
            "book": "textbook",
            "page": 149
          },
          "pronunciation": "Yunaga bakki chuunyaeyo."
        }
      ],
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "ask-01",
          "modelId": "travel-question",
          "explanation": "가다 and 하다 are action verbs and take -느냬요 for present questions.",
          "formA": {
