            "answer": "하느냬요"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-02",
          "modelId": "dream-question",
          "explanation": "싶다 and 작다 take adjective question ending -으냬 after the consonant.",
          "formA": {
            "prompt": "Report “What do you want to be?” 커서 뭐가 되고 ___ .",
            "choices": [
              "싶으냬요",
              "싶대요",
              "싶재요",
              "싶는냬요"
            ],
            "answer": "싶으냬요"
          },
          "formB": {
            "prompt": "Report “Is the tent small?” 텐트가 ___ .",
            "choices": [
              "작대요",
              "작재요",
              "작느냬요",
              "작으냬요"
            ],
            "answer": "작으냬요"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-03",
          "modelId": "cold-question",
          "explanation": "Adjectives use -(으)냬; 춥다 changes to 추우냬, and vowel-final 예쁘다 to 예쁘냬.",
          "formA": {
